{"nodes":[{"id":"7c000000000000a1","type":"text","x":360,"y":-720,"width":820,"height":110,"color":"6","text":"**测试与评估主流程**\n\n从生产运行事实到统一执行轨迹，再到 Eval Case、分层评估与回归比较的完整链路。"},{"id":"7c000000000000b1","type":"group","x":-40,"y":-500,"width":620,"height":500,"color":"5","label":"① 统一观测"},{"id":"7c000000000000b2","type":"group","x":-40,"y":60,"width":620,"height":360,"color":"6","label":"② 构造评估场景"},{"id":"7c000000000000b3","type":"group","x":780,"y":-500,"width":700,"height":600,"color":"4","label":"③ 分层评估"},{"id":"7c000000000000b4","type":"group","x":780,"y":100,"width":700,"height":490,"color":"5","label":"④ 回归与反馈"},{"id":"7c00000000000001","type":"text","x":30,"y":-460,"width":480,"height":90,"color":"5","text":"**生产运行**\n\n用户请求 → Agent Task\n各 Runtime 产生结构化事实"},{"id":"7c00000000000002","type":"text","x":30,"y":-340,"width":480,"height":170,"color":"5","text":"**统一执行轨迹**\n\nTask / Run / Trace 身份关联\nContextManifest / RetrievalRecord\nToolInvocation / ExecutionRecord\n\n[[3.Task、Run 与 Trace 身份关联|Task / Run / Trace]]"},{"id":"7c00000000000003","type":"text","x":30,"y":-140,"width":480,"height":140,"color":"5","text":"**数据边界**\n\n运行事实 / 观测数据 / 评估资产\n生产 Trace ≠ Eval Case\n\n[[6.运行事实、观测数据与评估资产边界|三层数据边界]]"},{"id":"7c00000000000004","type":"text","x":30,"y":100,"width":480,"height":150,"color":"6","text":"**Eval Case 与固定 Fixture**\n\n筛选 → 脱敏 → 状态冻结\nExpected Behavior / Rubric\n\n[[7.Evaluation Case 与测试数据集|Eval Case]]"},{"id":"7c00000000000005","type":"text","x":30,"y":280,"width":480,"height":110,"color":"6","text":"**三类 Dataset**\n\n核心能力集 / 边界与故障集\n/ 生产回归集"},{"id":"7c00000000000006","type":"text","x":830,"y":-460,"width":560,"height":130,"color":"4","text":"**上下文与 Evidence**\n\nRecall@K / Evidence Coverage\n/ Evidence Grounding\n\n[[8.Agent 分层评估|分层评估]]"},{"id":"7c00000000000007","type":"text","x":830,"y":-300,"width":560,"height":120,"color":"4","text":"**Tool / Action**\n\nTool Selection / 参数正确性\n不必要调用 / 禁止行为"},{"id":"7c00000000000008","type":"text","x":830,"y":-150,"width":560,"height":110,"color":"4","text":"**Agent Trajectory**\n\nrequired / forbidden / ordering\n/ recovery 关键行为约束"},{"id":"7c00000000000009","type":"text","x":830,"y":-10,"width":560,"height":100,"color":"4","text":"**Final Task**\n\n任务完成 / 约束遵守\n事实一致 / 领域质量"},{"id":"7c0000000000000a","type":"text","x":830,"y":140,"width":560,"height":140,"color":"5","text":"**Rubric 与 LLM-as-Judge**\n\n确定性判断优先\nRubric 离散等级 / JudgeInput\n\n[[9.Rubric 与 LLM-as-Judge|Rubric / Judge]]"},{"id":"7c0000000000000b","type":"text","x":830,"y":310,"width":560,"height":130,"color":"5","text":"**Regression 比较**\n\n硬门槛 / 质量指标 / 效率指标\nPASS / FAIL / REVIEW\n\n[[10.Regression 与质量反馈闭环|Regression]]"},{"id":"7c0000000000000c","type":"text","x":830,"y":470,"width":560,"height":100,"color":"5","text":"**发布 / 生产回流**\n\n通过后进入下一版本\n生产失败回流为新 Eval Case"},{"id":"7c000000000000d1","type":"text","x":1700,"y":-400,"width":380,"height":150,"color":"6","text":"**旁注 · 身份语义**\n\ntask_id / run_id 以第一章为准\n[[4.Conversation 与 Task 生命周期|身份模型]]"},{"id":"7c000000000000d2","type":"text","x":1700,"y":-210,"width":380,"height":150,"color":"6","text":"**旁注 · 生产治理指标**\n\n支撑治理的运行指标归第六章\n[[8.轻量运行监控|轻量运行监控]]"}],"edges":[{"id":"7d00000000000001","fromNode":"7c00000000000001","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"7c00000000000002","toSide":"top"},{"id":"7d00000000000002","fromNode":"7c00000000000002","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"7c00000000000003","toSide":"top"},{"id":"7d00000000000003","fromNode":"7c00000000000003","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"7c00000000000004","toSide":"top","label":"筛选 / 脱敏 / 冻结"},{"id":"7d00000000000004","fromNode":"7c00000000000004","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"7c00000000000005","toSide":"top","label":"三类 Dataset"},{"id":"7d00000000000005","fromNode":"7c00000000000005","fromSide":"right","toNode":"7c00000000000006","toSide":"left","label":"按 Case 运行"},{"id":"7d00000000000006","fromNode":"7c00000000000006","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"7c00000000000007","toSide":"top"},{"id":"7d00000000000007","fromNode":"7c00000000000007","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"7c00000000000008","toSide":"top"},{"id":"7d00000000000008","fromNode":"7c00000000000008","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"7c00000000000009","toSide":"top"},{"id":"7d00000000000009","fromNode":"7c00000000000009","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"7c0000000000000a","toSide":"top"},{"id":"7d0000000000000a","fromNode":"7c0000000000000a","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"7c0000000000000b","toSide":"top"},{"id":"7d0000000000000b","fromNode":"7c0000000000000b","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"7c0000000000000c","toSide":"top"},{"id":"7d0000000000000c","fromNode":"7c0000000000000c","fromSide":"left","toNode":"7c00000000000005","toSide":"left","label":"生产失败回流为新 Case"}]}